   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2016, CDC invested $20 million into EuroMena III, alongside the IFC, the EIB, and other European DFIs, including Germany&apos;s DEG and France&apos;s Proparco.The fund manager is looking to make between eight to 10 investments of between $10 million to $20 million, and is targeting a total fund size of $150 million.Our investment will support the growth of businesses in the focus regions.</narrative>
